From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libc: isolate the app environment from host runtime state

apklayer patch (docs/PATCHES.md). Reuse AOSP bionic/libc/bionic/env.cpp's
licensed environment implementation with private storage and host pthread
locking. Application mutations, putenv ownership and direct environ replacement
never change glibc's environment. Both linker relocations and dlsym resolve the
actual environ pointer slot. A registered active-ABI backend can own that slot
and the same getter/setter API. Service and diagnostic host views use glibc.
Initial Android defaults follow init.environ.rc.in and bionic paths.h; an
explicit child environment is restored verbatim through the preload callback.

